# Build-context upload filter for `gcloud builds submit .` (scripts/deploy_cloudrun.sh).
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS — without it, gcloud auto-generates a .gcloudignore from
# .gitignore (it does `#!include:.gitignore`) and applies those patterns as PURE
# excludes. Critically, gcloud does NOT honor git's tracked-file protection: even
# though agent/*/.claude/** is committed, .gitignore's `.claude/` line makes gcloud
# strip it from the uploaded context. The agent Dockerfiles then `COPY agent/<name>/`
# into /workspace with NO .claude/ — so launch.py's `from _push import push` dies with
# `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named '_push'`, and the claude CLI boots with no
# settings.json -> zero hooks (no dispatch validation, no event streaming, no finalize).
#
# So we DELIBERATELY do NOT `#!include:.gitignore` here, and we do NOT list `.claude/`.
# Per-image filtering still happens at the Docker layer (root .dockerignore +
# deploy/<name>.Dockerfile.dockerignore). This file only keeps the UPLOAD lean and
# keeps secrets out. Verify with: `gcloud meta list-files-for-upload .`

# --- Git / Editor / OS ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo

# Local Claude Code tooling at the repo ROOT only — worktrees (full repo copies!),
# plugin cache, session state. The leading `/` anchors this to the context root so it
# does NOT touch agent/main-agent/.claude/ or agent/sub-agent/.claude/, which the
# images need. Without the anchor we'd upload .claude/worktrees/** = many repo copies.
/.claude/

# --- Python build & cache ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
build/
dist/

# --- Web / Node (no image built here needs it) ---
node_modules/
web/

# --- Secrets — NEVER upload (defense-in-depth with .dockerignore) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*-sa-key.json
gcs-sa-key.json
*.pem

# --- Local data ---
.artifacts/
*.log
wandb/

# NOTE: intentionally NO `.claude/` line. The agent images require
# agent/main-agent/.claude/ and agent/sub-agent/.claude/ (hooks + settings.json).
